  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Given, diameter of spherical ball <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>cm</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.01</mn><mi>&#160;m</mi></math><br /><br />Radius of spherical ball <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0.01</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi>&#160;m</mi></math><br /><br />Density of spherical ball <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#961;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mi>&#160;kg</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><msup><mrow><mn>m</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><br />Density of liquid <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#963;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mi>&#160;kg</mi><msup><mrow><mi>&#160;m</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><br />Coefficient of viscosity <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>&#951;</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0.1</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>N</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>s</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mn>m</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><br />We know that,<br /><br />Terminal velocity is given by<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mfrac><mrow><mi>g</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#961;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#963;</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mi>&#951;</mi></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mn>0.01</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>0.1</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;m&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>10</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;m&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><br />Distance travelled in one second after attaining terminal velocity<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>10</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>&#160;m</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi>&#160;m</mi></math>",
